<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia's August trade surplus seen at $938 mln.</title>
<headline>Indonesia's August trade surplus seen at $938 mln.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's trade surplus in August stood at $937.89 million compared to $508.5 million in July and $148.5 million in August last year, official sources said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The sources gave no further details.</p>
<p>The government will announce the final figures following the monthly cabinet meeting on the economy around 0500 GMT.</p>
</text>
